# Machine ceilings for one HAICGU compute node (2 x Kunpeng 920, 64 cores/socket,
# 4 NUMA domains of 32 cores, no SMT). KIND THREADS PLACES SCOPE; PLACES is an
# OMP_PLACES value, core numbering from lscpu: NUMA0 = 0-31, socket 0 = 0-63.
membw    128 cores   node
membw    64  {0}:64  socket
membw    32  {0}:32  numa
membw    1   {0}     core
peak_fma 128 cores   node
peak_fma 64  {0}:64  socket
peak_fma 1   {0}     core
